 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? It' completely normal to feel guilty. Lots of people do. But remember that taking short breaks every hour or so helps you stay focused and productive in the long run. So, what do you usually do during those breaks? Want to go outside for some fresh air, Honestly, anything that gives your mind a chance to rest but your body keeps moving. A quick walk, a cup of coffee, a few push-ups, whatever feels good. Exactly. Lots of small wins during the day add up to a happy, healthy person at the end of the week. Great. And maybe a quick walk after lunch. Short and sweet.",
